{
  "_comment": "K4 contract: how an address a Hauflo entity uses and others use too is classified — backend/src/ha/overlap.ts (overlapKind) and the agent's _overlap_kind answer these the same. holders: [platform | null (an exposure / the time server / a device without an entity), KNX scene number | null].",
  "cases": [
